<view class="screen"><view class="mode-banner">{{modeLabel}}</view><text class="page-title">微信采购者管理</text>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在核对管理员身份…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{processing}}">重新读取与核对</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !allowed}}" class="surface"><text class="heading">仅平台管理员可以授权采购者</text><text class="body-copy">普通微信登录不授予管理权限，也不支持通过填写邮箱认领微信账号。</text><button class="secondary" data-page="mine" bindtap="go">返回我的</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && allowed}}">
    <view class="note">请让采购者先在云端小程序登录，在“我的”复制账户编号，再核对本人身份后添加。商品、订单和售后权限分别控制，账号绑定后不可转让。</view>
    <view class="section-title"><text class="heading">已绑定采购者</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{processing}}">刷新</button></view>
    <view wx:for="{{merchants}}" wx:key="id" class="surface"><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">{{item.name}}</text><text class="status-tag">{{item.status === 'enabled' ? '已启用' : '已停用'}}</text></view><text class="body-copy">{{item.region}} · {{item.permissionText}}</text><text class="account-id" selectable="{{true}}">{{item.userId}}</text><button class="secondary wide" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit" disabled="{{processing}}">修改权限或启停</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!merchants.length}}" class="empty">还没有微信采购者档案。</view>
    <view id="merchant-management-panel" class="surface management-panel"><view class="section-title"><text class="heading">{{form.id ? '编辑采购者' : '添加采购者'}}</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="create" disabled="{{processing}}">清空新增</button></view><text class="field-label">云端账户编号</text><textarea class="description-input account-input" maxlength="71" value="{{form.userId}}" disabled="{{!!form.id || processing}}" data-field="userId" bindinput="field" placeholder="wechat: 开头的完整账户编号"/><text class="field-label">采购者名称（模拟资料）</text><input class="input-box" maxlength="80" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="field"/><text class="field-label">负责地区</text><input class="input-box" maxlength="100" value="{{form.region}}" data-field="region" bindinput="field" placeholder="如：甘肃 · 景泰"/>
      <view class="info-row"><text>商品与库存管理</text><switch checked="{{form.products}}" data-field="products" bindchange="toggle" color="#28654b"/></view><view class="info-row"><text>订单模拟发货</text><switch checked="{{form.orders}}" data-field="orders" bindchange="toggle" color="#28654b"/></view><view class="info-row"><text>售后模拟处理</text><switch checked="{{form.aftersales}}" data-field="aftersales" bindchange="toggle" color="#28654b"/></view><view class="info-row"><text>启用采购者</text><switch checked="{{form.enabled}}" data-field="enabled" bindchange="toggle" color="#28654b"/></view><button class="primary wide" bindtap="save" loading="{{processing}}" disabled="{{processing}}">{{form.id ? '保存授权变更' : '核对并添加采购者'}}</button></view>
  </view><view class="note">仅绑定当前小程序已验证的微信账号；不通过邮箱匹配旧网页账号，不会自动迁移原有商品或订单归属。</view><view class="bottom-space"></view>
</view>
